## Technical Resolution Summary

| Issue | Resolution |
| :--- | :--- |
| **500 Error / API** | Implemented [(prisma as any)](file:///home/melwinabi/Documents/Smart_Hub/src/app/api/auth/%5B...nextauth%5D/route.ts#114-121) workarounds and explicit `Number()` parsing for `userId`. |
| **Stale Sessions** | Updated [jwt](file:///home/melwinabi/Documents/Smart_Hub/src/app/api/auth/%5B...nextauth%5D/route.ts#114-121) and [session](file:///home/melwinabi/Documents/Smart_Hub/src/app/api/auth/%5B...nextauth%5D/route.ts#121-128) callbacks to prioritize database IDs over token `sub`. |
| **Hydration Mismatch** | Suppressed via `mounted` state checks and `suppressHydrationWarning`. |
| **Confirmation Dialogs** | Replaced `window.confirm` with a custom React modal for better testability and UX. |
